 am packing for a short trip with uncertain weather and a return time that may slip. How would you keep the plan workable?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s1","source_id":"6940ad9f-9705-444d-9e1b-e574f4006ea0","text":"Given the uncertainty of the weather and your return time, I'd recommend a flexible approach to stay \"workable,\" as you put it.\n\nFor a short trip, it usually helps to be flexible with your packing and to keep some items versatile. Here are a few \"workable\" tips:\n\n*   **Packing:** Pack layers, even if the forecast isn't definitive. This allows you to add or remove layers as needed.\n*   **Time Buffer:** Since the return time might slip, aim to pack for a bit longer than you think you need to. A small buffer of extra time/supplies is better than rushing.\n*   **Flexibility:** Keep your primary plan flexible. If the weather changes or your time shifts, your plan should be easy to pivot without starting over from scratch.\n\nDoes that sound like a good starting point for planning?"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"external_supported","monitor_id":"candidate:e-22d88dbb527ab00ee256c618","provenance_group_keys":["external:9af74297-d548-41f6-8b1e-f265eb259e77"],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1"]},"evidence":{"end":123,"quote":"I am packing for a short trip with uncertain weather and a return time that may slip. How would you keep the plan workable?","source_slot":"s0","start":0},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-22d88dbb527ab00ee256c618","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligibl